{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/40835-interest-in-a-play-by-post-game","id":40835,"title":"Interest in a Play-by-Post Game?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-01T17:24:39-08:00","id":40835,"title":"Interest in a Play-by-Post Game?","content":"Okay, I want to run a game on the new Play-By-Post forum on here, and I have an idea. Tell me what you think of it, and would anyone be interested in joining it.<br /> <br /> The first idea is a New World of Darkness game, BUT we will NOT use GMC or B&amp;S as I neither own nor like either of these updates. It would focus on Vampire: The Requiem and Changeling: The Lost, though Hunters would be present as NPC's. The setting is the fictional city of Verona Beach, California (based primarily off of Los Angeles). In this game, the Strix and VII are assumed to not exist.<br /> <br /> The idea is that the Prince of Verona Beach is an Elder Mekhet who has ruled Verona Beach for several decades and has allowed three covenants to set up shop in the city. These three covenants are the Invictus, Lancea Sanctum, and Circle of the Crone. All of them must pay tribute to the Prince, and not fight between each other. But when the Prince has gone missing and Belial's Brood have hit the scene, things are about to take a turn for the worse.<br /> <br /> The following covenants are playable at the start: Lancea Sanctum, Circle of the Crone, Invictus, Unaligned. The Carthians and Ordo Dracul will be added later as the story advances.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T23:42:11-08:00","id":40946,"title":"","content":"I'd be interested in getting in on this. I haven't had the chance to play in a V:tR game as of yet but I am currently running a chronicle for my table top group. I'd love to see your take on the game and get a chance to actually play.<br /> <br /> I'd most likely be interested in playing a member of the Circle of the Crone as that is the covenant I am most hard at work fleshing out for my own chronicle. I'd be interested in hearing more about the Verona Beach setting though before I made a final call on that. Often times facets of people's settings really grab me and I run with them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1744-thantrax","name":"Thantrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1744_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T03:10:21-08:00","id":41001,"title":"","content":"Sounds like something I like to sink my teeth into (literally). I do have the V:tR corebook and can get the PDFs of the other ones if I can do this right. This can iron out some details I need for my Austin by Night idea (just a side project I had for years).<br /> <br /> I also got the old Dark Ages book if people are interested...just have to put up with a Malkie with an obsession for chess. He can be so annoying if someone takes his queen...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T07:20:57-08:00","id":41095,"title":"","content":"Excellent, I am working on fleshing out the setting as we speak. Should have more posted later today and tomorrow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T12:30:35-08:00","id":43059,"title":"","content":"I am also interested. Looking forward to more information.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This is what will happen when I am confronted with zombies: <a href=\"http://youtu.be/OQDn5Qy2kio?t=5m57s\" target=\"_blank\">http://youtu.be/OQDn5Qy2kio?t=5m57s</a><br /> <br /> And then I will become this: <a href=\"http://youtu.be/czJLl8m3P7o?t=2m52s\" target=\"_blank\">http://youtu.be/czJLl8m3P7o?t=2m52s</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1325-lochleinn","name":"Lochleinn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-07T00:06:15-08:00","id":43993,"title":"","content":"I also might be interested! don't know much about changeling but I could give it a go.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/749-worldscoolestlose